{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022751_968f733d","chunk_index":16,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ae1d1fb8450d1498","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_853d5ef9216b528b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_92c510d2c44bc5b4","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_54b16d7c77a11828"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022751_968f733d","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"病例报告表","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"正文依据已确认事实：筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访4周；基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视与第20周安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价；安全性数据涵盖TEAE、严重不良事件、导致停药的不良事件及实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价；入选条件包括年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月及筛选和基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3。医学作者需核对：病例报告表的载体形式与填写、修改规程，数据记录与核对的责任分工，不良事件及妊娠相关信息的记录范围，以及DLQI采集时点与量表授权状态。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ae1d1fb8450d1498","section_number":"10.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022751_968f733d","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"数据源的定义","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"正文依据已确认事实界定数据源：病例报告表记录筛选期至第20周安全性随访采集的数据，受试者日记和药品计数记录用于依从性评价，疗效评价涉及PASI、sPGA和DLQI，安全性数据涉及不良事件、实验室检查、生命体征和12导联心电图。医学作者需核对：源文件的界定范围、受试者日记的填写与回收要求、数据差异处理流程，以及是否需要纳入研究中心以外的数据源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_853d5ef9216b528b","section_number":"10.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022751_968f733d","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"数据质量保证","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"多中心设计是正文覆盖全部研究数据的直接依据；已确认资料未给出本项目监查、稽查与数据核查的具体安排，正文仅采用不指定系统、时限和职责分工的通用表述。医学作者需确认：本项目监查与稽查的范围、方式与频次，数据核查流程与问题处理要求，以及质量保证职责的落实方式。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_92c510d2c44bc5b4","section_number":"10.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922022751_968f733d","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","quote":"章节编号=10.4\n章节标题=资料保存与数据保护","quote_sha256":"c99261d6ee0ca7d3c1338e11036c2dd0cecc30ee742d561f74fc88bd40f34e49","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","span_id":"sp_pkt_drp"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"sp_sd_region"}],"evidence_span_ids":["sp_pkt_drp","sp_sd_region"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"资料保存与数据保护","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"资料保存与数据保护的范围包括研究资料归档与保存，以及受试者隐私和个人数据保护的相关要求。本研究在中国开展，研究资料的保存和受试者数据的处理应遵循适用的法律法规、监管要求和伦理要求。研究资料在保存期内应保持完整、清晰并可追溯，保存期限应符合适用的法规及监管要求，资料的归档与到期处理应留有记录。数据保护应保障受试者身份信息的保密性，研究数据的访问、使用与对外提供应受到适当管理，防止未经授权的访问、泄露、丢失或更改；研究数据仅用于本研究及相关目的，研究结果公开发表时应保证受试者身份不可识别。研究结束后的资料归档与移交应符合适用要求，以确保研究记录在需要时可被检索和核查。","rationale":"已确认研究在中国开展，正文据此采用中国监管与伦理语境下的通用保存与保护原则，未设定具体保存期限、技术措施或责任分工。医学作者需确认：研究资料的具体保存期限与到期处理要求，数据访问、传输与对外提供的管理要求，受试者隐私保护与发表审核要求，以及归档与移交安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_54b16d7c77a11828","section_number":"10.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:77372701692fa8d7afe37b73","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"16485d8c3f1d5694d853120c46a80788acf03ec34cdc665be7b0cc2dbf0e9557"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:数据质量保证|block:932|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:28e671543798db","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"84e30f7a8178b6ecebc4f6b8272c753029708f78a4aea8f02201d0abf4225b0b"}]}